/** Same as `alignWith`, but forgets from the type that one of the two elements must be present. Example: {{{ scala> import cats.syntax.all._ scala> Align[List].padZipWith(List(1, 2), List(10, 11, 12))(_ |+| _) res0: List[Option[Int]] = List(Some(11), Some(13), Some(12)) }}} */
